      "content": "1. 839                                           HIGH STREET                                               (South Side)                                               No 119                                                 (Formerly listed as                                               NO 95) SP 99()7 BW 1/25        29.7.50.               II                        GV 2. Late C18 stucco fronted house, slate roof.  2 storeys, 3 sashes with glazing bars in reveals.  Steps with wrought iron railings up to doorway with Doric pilasters, entablature with triglyphs.  Eaves cornice. Nos l17 to 121 (odd) form a group. Listing NGR: SP9936707714"
